<title>USA: Cyclone Karlette threatens shipping in Indian Ocea.</title>
<headline>Cyclone Karlette threatens shipping in Indian Ocea.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Karlette, with 50 mph winds, is in the Indian Ocean near 15.3s/77.2e moving west at 7 mph, forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>A turn to the west southwest is likely as Karlette slowly intensifies. Karlette is only a primarily a threat to shipping at this time.</p>
